{"page":493,"width":1672,"height":2532,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"554","words":[{"text":"554","x":178,"y":144,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 12 입출력 시스템","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":304,"y":147,"width":115,"height":27},{"text":"12","x":431,"y":147,"width":35,"height":22},{"text":"입출력","x":494,"y":146,"width":62,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":565,"y":147,"width":62,"height":24}]},{"text":"수 있도록 해준다. 이러면 기은터(counter)는 정밀도가 높은 시계 역힐을 하게 된다. 그","words":[{"text":"수","x":305,"y":269,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있도록","x":350,"y":268,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"해준다.","x":451,"y":267,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"이러면","x":560,"y":268,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"기은터(counter)는","x":660,"y":267,"width":257,"height":37},{"text":"정밀도가","x":931,"y":269,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"높은","x":1064,"y":272,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"시계","x":1142,"y":271,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"역힐을","x":1222,"y":272,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"하게","x":1331,"y":271,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":1410,"y":270,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1494,"y":277,"width":29,"height":23}]},{"text":"러나 이러한 높은 정밀도를 가지는 클록은 통상 인터럽트를 생성하는 데 시용되지는 못","words":[{"text":"러나","x":308,"y":325,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"이러한","x":379,"y":325,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"높은","x":480,"y":326,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"정밀도를","x":554,"y":325,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"가지는","x":684,"y":325,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"클록은","x":783,"y":325,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"통상","x":885,"y":325,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":960,"y":326,"width":155,"height":36},{"text":"생성하는","x":1129,"y":329,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"데","x":1274,"y":329,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"시용되지는","x":1319,"y":328,"width":163,"height":35},{"text":"못","x":1494,"y":330,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"하며 단지 시간 간격의 정확한 측정을 제공한다.","words":[{"text":"하며","x":306,"y":384,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"단지","x":377,"y":384,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"시간","x":449,"y":383,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"간격의","x":519,"y":384,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"정확한","x":620,"y":384,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"측정을","x":716,"y":383,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"제공한다.","x":817,"y":383,"width":125,"height":35}]},{"text":"12.3.4 봉쇄형과 비봉쇄형 입출력 BlockingandNonb10cking1/O","words":[{"text":"12.3.4","x":304,"y":494,"width":137,"height":28},{"text":"봉쇄형과","x":478,"y":491,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"비봉쇄형","x":603,"y":492,"width":108,"height":34},{"text":"입출력","x":727,"y":491,"width":78,"height":35},{"text":"BlockingandNonb10cking1/O","x":832,"y":501,"width":429,"height":27}]},{"text":"시스템 콜 인터페이스와 관련된 나머지 한 가지 이슈는 봉쇄형과 비봉쇄형(비동기식:","words":[{"text":"시스템","x":305,"y":564,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"콜","x":413,"y":566,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"인터페이스와","x":460,"y":564,"width":180,"height":36},{"text":"관련된","x":653,"y":565,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"나머지","x":758,"y":563,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":862,"y":564,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":909,"y":564,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"이슈는","x":985,"y":564,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"봉쇄형과","x":1093,"y":564,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"비봉쇄형(비동기식:","x":1243,"y":563,"width":279,"height":38}]},{"text":"asynchronous) 방법 간의 선택 문제이다. 프로그램이 봉쇄형(blocking) 시스템","words":[{"text":"asynchronous)","x":303,"y":626,"width":226,"height":38},{"text":"방법","x":545,"y":623,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"간의","x":618,"y":624,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"선택","x":691,"y":623,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"문제이다.","x":761,"y":622,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램이","x":977,"y":622,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"봉쇄형(blocking)","x":1148,"y":622,"width":266,"height":40},{"text":"시스템","x":1432,"y":622,"width":88,"height":35}]},{"text":"콜을 하면, 호출 스레드는 봉쇄 상태로 들어가게 된다. 즉, 운영체제가 이 스레드를 실행","words":[{"text":"콜을","x":303,"y":681,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"하면,","x":378,"y":681,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"호출","x":459,"y":682,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"스레드는","x":531,"y":682,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"봉쇄","x":661,"y":682,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"상태로","x":731,"y":681,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"들어가게","x":831,"y":681,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":965,"y":681,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"즉,","x":1046,"y":682,"width":39,"height":34},{"text":"운영체제가","x":1099,"y":680,"width":164,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1276,"y":680,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"스레드를","x":1320,"y":680,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"실행","x":1464,"y":681,"width":56,"height":36}]},{"text":"큐로부터 대기 큐로 옮긴다. 추후 입출력이 언젠가 끝나면 이 스레드는 다시 실행 큐로","words":[{"text":"큐로부터","x":302,"y":740,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"대기","x":441,"y":740,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"큐로","x":513,"y":743,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"옮긴다.","x":585,"y":740,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"추후","x":696,"y":740,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"입출력이","x":769,"y":739,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"언젠가","x":902,"y":738,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"끝나면","x":1005,"y":739,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":1114,"y":739,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"스레드는","x":1160,"y":739,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"다시","x":1305,"y":739,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"실행","x":1386,"y":739,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"큐로","x":1462,"y":742,"width":61,"height":32}]},{"text":"되돌아오며, 그 후에는 언젠가 다시 실행을 재시작할 수 있다. 실행이 재개되면 응용 프","words":[{"text":"되돌아오며,","x":304,"y":797,"width":160,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":478,"y":803,"width":30,"height":23},{"text":"후에는","x":520,"y":798,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"언젠가","x":624,"y":798,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"다시","x":722,"y":797,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"실행을","x":794,"y":797,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"재시작할","x":896,"y":797,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1030,"y":797,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1077,"y":797,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"실행이","x":1163,"y":797,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"재개되면","x":1275,"y":798,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"응용","x":1418,"y":798,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"프","x":1493,"y":803,"width":30,"height":25}]},{"text":"로그램은 입출력 시스템 콜이 되돌려 준 값을 받게 된다. 그런데 입출력 장치에 의해 수","words":[{"text":"로그램은","x":302,"y":856,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"입출력","x":440,"y":856,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":541,"y":856,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"콜이","x":641,"y":856,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"되돌려","x":713,"y":855,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"준","x":812,"y":857,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"값을","x":856,"y":855,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"받게","x":928,"y":855,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"된다.","x":1001,"y":854,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"그런데","x":1085,"y":855,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"입출력","x":1197,"y":856,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"장치에","x":1307,"y":856,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"의해","x":1419,"y":856,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1492,"y":857,"width":31,"height":34}]},{"text":"행되는 작업은 일반적으로 비동기식(asynchronous)으로 수행 시간이 다양하며 예측하","words":[{"text":"행되는","x":302,"y":913,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"작업은","x":407,"y":914,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"일반적으로","x":510,"y":914,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"비동기식(asynchronous)으로","x":669,"y":913,"width":419,"height":41},{"text":"수행","x":1100,"y":913,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"시간이","x":1178,"y":913,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"다양하며","x":1289,"y":914,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"예측하","x":1432,"y":914,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"기 어렵다. 그럼에도 불구하고 운영체제는 봉쇄형 코드가 비봉쇄형 코드보다 작성하기","words":[{"text":"기","x":304,"y":971,"width":24,"height":35},{"text":"어렵다.","x":348,"y":971,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"그럼에도","x":461,"y":971,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"불구하고","x":594,"y":972,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"운영체제는","x":726,"y":971,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"봉쇄형","x":891,"y":971,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"코드가","x":997,"y":971,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"비봉쇄형","x":1108,"y":971,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"코드보다","x":1253,"y":973,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"작성하기","x":1399,"y":972,"width":120,"height":36}]},{"text":"쉽기 때문에 응용 인터페이스에 대해 봉쇄형 시스템 콜을 제공한다.","words":[{"text":"쉽기","x":303,"y":1029,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"때문에","x":376,"y":1029,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"응용","x":475,"y":1029,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"인터페이스에","x":548,"y":1030,"width":174,"height":35},{"text":"대해","x":736,"y":1029,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"봉쇄형","x":805,"y":1029,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":907,"y":1029,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"콜을","x":1009,"y":1029,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1084,"y":1029,"width":136,"height":35}]},{"text":"그러나 어떤 A卜음자 프로그램들은 비봉쇄형(nonblockmg) 입출력이 필요하다. 대","words":[{"text":"그러나","x":359,"y":1088,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"어떤","x":465,"y":1087,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"A卜음자","x":537,"y":1088,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램들은","x":640,"y":1088,"width":180,"height":34},{"text":"비봉쇄형(nonblockmg)","x":834,"y":1088,"width":345,"height":40},{"text":"입출력이","x":1199,"y":1088,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"필요하다.","x":1346,"y":1089,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"대","x":1494,"y":1089,"width":25,"height":35}]},{"text":"표적인 예는 스크린에 다른 자료를 표시하거나 연산을 하는 중에 키보드와 마우스 입력","words":[{"text":"표적인","x":301,"y":1145,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"예는","x":407,"y":1146,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"스크린에","x":478,"y":1146,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":610,"y":1146,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"자료를","x":682,"y":1146,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"표시하거나","x":784,"y":1146,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"연산을","x":950,"y":1145,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"하는","x":1054,"y":1146,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"중에","x":1130,"y":1146,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"키보드와","x":1211,"y":1147,"width":131,"height":35},{"text":"마우스","x":1355,"y":1147,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"입력","x":1466,"y":1147,"width":53,"height":35}]},{"text":"을 받아들이는 경우이다. 또 다른 예로는 비디오 응용 프로그램으로서 한쪽에서는 디스